{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":394327,\"title\":\"The Balloon Goes Up\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Balloon unit WAAFs catch German spies.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zf9aBJqWbAGIijhQqONwhCk6i01.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":5.8,\"voteCount\":4,\"year\":1942,\"runtime\":58,\"genres\":[\"War\",\"Music\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Redd Davis\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1550631,\"name\":\"Redd Davis\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1610175,\"name\":\"Ethel Revnell\",\"character\":\"Ethel\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1610177,\"name\":\"Gracie West\",\"character\":\"Gracie\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":592570,\"name\":\"Ronald Shiner\",\"character\":\"Sergeant Shiner\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zTruk0LK1TfWhFHxjQyjX1z4W9l.jpg\"},{\"id\":1610178,\"name\":\"Donald Peers\",\"character\":\"Sergeant Jim\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":109850,\"name\":\"Gordon McLeod\",\"character\":\"The Doctor\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xTu72Z3qQAo2OrjG5z2kZVBG9W5.jpg\"},{\"id\":1839404,\"name\":\"Gertrude Maesmore Morris\",\"character\":\"Lady Hurst\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":30583,\"name\":\"Elsie Wagstaff\",\"character\":\"The Welfare Officer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6JuFAqsqNfRnUP6LOoOfVzC1DMM.jpg\"},{\"id\":1839405,\"name\":\"Esma Lewis\",\"character\":\"Sergeant Agnes\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1839406,\"name\":\"Miles Silverton\",\"character\":\"The Commanding Officer\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":253414,\"title\":\"Rock the Kasbah\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jGNOsJjpsJ4yWe3InuiXgYk8VuW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wldeDiuEBhYi1Q4FjSHzAQ3yS80.jpg\",\"rating\":5.4,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A washed-up music producer finds one last shot at redemption with a golden-voiced young girl in Afghanistan. However, when jealousy gets the better of a disgruntled ex-boyfriend, he decides to oppose the young star with talent of his own.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Music\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1630545,\"title\":\"Le Temps d'une Tartine 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/an8FGJS0YFbWENUtVrBQiboMMTp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dJzuhtmpBYeQEpmSpVlsnI6RJp8.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While Mixel tries the best he can to help along with Martin's parents, Charlène and Martin have escaped the flames and appeared somewhen else, where twists and turns won't end. Why is everything happening? To find that out... they must go Back to the Toaster!\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":840326,\"title\":\"Sisu\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xgb30M1wL4nibyFvlHh3w4XlDYq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pBdQ4iorzRV2G38mdS6rzrmUfMA.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When an ex-soldier who discovers gold in the Lapland wilderness tries to take the loot into the city, German soldiers led by a brutal SS officer battle him.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"War\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":270457,\"title\":\"D-Day: Normandy 1944\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7WLbmyZEqjGKt5VLnrG0TfXUV2E.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2gDxYeHVXckGy0Zs9kLbz8couRS.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"June 6, 1944: The largest Allied operation of World War II began in Normandy, France. Yet, few know in detail exactly why and how, from the end of 1943 through August 1944, this region became the most important location in the world. Blending multiple cinematographic techniques, including animation, CGI and stunning live-action images, “D-Day: Normandy 1944” brings this monumental event to the world’s largest screens for the first time ever. Audiences of all ages, including new generations, will discover from a new perspective how this landing changed the world. Exploring history, military strategy, science, technology and human values, the film will educate and appeal to all.  Narrated by Tom Brokaw, “D-Day: Normandy 1944” pays tribute to those who gave their lives for our freedom… A duty of memory, a duty of gratitude.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5707,\"title\":\"Shooting War\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/81XtyZfL5WFPJXVLUUQP9PQP6Hl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A remarkable film that takes a special look at the first war to be truly reported and recorded by one of the more unsung heroes of World War II: the combat photographer. Through the unflinching eye of their camera's lenses, these courageous soldiers continually risked their lives in their brave attempts to capture history.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Action\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":456227,\"title\":\"What the War Meant\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3ZfuOU3eyjQ9YeOx5pEC0BZ1JWG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The drama stars Beat Takeshi as General Hideki Tojo, who served as Prime Minister of Japan during World War II and was later executed as a war criminal. The story's theme is said to be a look at how the Pacific War began, focusing mostly on the three month period between the Imperial Conference (Gozen Kaigi) on September 6, 1941, and the attack on Pearl Harbor on December 7, 1941.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1627810,\"title\":\"Children of the Blitz\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gvrDhyU0IeO6I6ViXLjvzUXMUXA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During The Blitz, the British government had plans in place to evacuate approximately 3.5 million people, but only around 1.5 million left towns and cities for the countryside, with the majority of those being children. Children of the Blitz tells the stories of those who remained at home, often to help their families, or because their parents couldn’t bear to send them away.  Through the eyes of survivors who were children at the time, the film will explore how The Blitz contributed towards our sense of national identity and how the ‘Blitz Spirit’ is still held up as a defining characteristic of Britishness today. The film will also examine the starker reality for children whose homes were destroyed, including those who lost parents, and some who were left to fend for themselves - many grew up with their stories unheard.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":844249,\"title\":\"Grandmother Told Grandmother\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/drh85Y5hYfRd4Sz9ZcUy3dJRNz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The little-known story of Ukrainian children torn from their homes in the crush between the Nazi and Soviet fronts in World War II. Spending their childhood as refugees in Europe, these inspiring individuals later immigrated to the United States, creating new homes and communities through their grit, faith and deep belief in the importance of preserving culture.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"HdexwdIqdvs\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Ywxo6lObyVE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"-xlIr_HolGU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}